WEBVTT

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.290
Tsutsui!

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:13.330
The movie version of Nose Blade is in theaters now!

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.500
Special Nation-wide Showing

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.200
Wanna go see it this Sunday?

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:20.330
Oh, sounds good! Oh, I wonder if Sunday will work...

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.580
You can't go?

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.540
Well, we're gonna be making
a family trip to the cemetery.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:27.830
I'll do something about it.

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:30.120
No, no! You should go make a proper visit!

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:32.120
It's okay I can go by myself!

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.000
Oh! Ayado said that she likes NoBla too.

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.040
Huh?

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:43.330
There's... no way I can ask a girl out.

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:48.290
Well, Ayado probably knows it really well,
so it won't be that different from going with m-

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:50.580
But you and Ayado are absolutely not the same!

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:54.870
Uh, sorry.

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:56.330
It's fine...

00:00:56.660 --> 00:01:01.040
You're right. We are different people. Sorry.

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:16.080
Ichiban daijin a koto wa
The most important thing

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:20.200
Daremo shiranai koto nanda
Is something nobody knows

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:24.290
Are mo kore mo daijina you de
Things which may be considered important

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.830
Toki ga sugireba kiete yuku
May fade away as time goes by

00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:35.620
Kaze ni notte kumo no kirema ni
Romance in pale pink

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:42.000
Tadayou no wa omoide no you na
Like the palm of a hand which has begun to color

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:51.370
Irozuki hajimeta te no hira no you na
Riding on the wind

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:58.040
Usubeni iro no koigokoro
Just like memories drifting in the break in the clouds

00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:03.370
Toki wo kakenuke yagate kuru
The new season will come soon

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:09.330
Atarashii kisetsu yume to wa sukoshi chigau
Leaping through time

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:12.830
Tada oboeteiru koto wa
And it's little different from a dream

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:18.750
Daijina koto nanda
But the things I remember are very important

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:24.450
Ichiban daijina kotoba
The most important words

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:28.580
Daremo iwazuni owarisou
May never be said to anybody

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:32.540
Are mo kore mo daijoubu sa
Everything will be all right

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:36.500
Toki ga sugitemo oboeteru
Even though time passes, I will remember

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:40.370
Anata no koto wa oboeteru
I will remember you

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:47.830
About the Love of a Best Friend
That I Worry About.

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:01.660
Oh, Ito-senpai!

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:03.910
Senpai?

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.620
U-um!

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:20.160
Ito, so you're going to the movie
with Ayado after all, huh?

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:24.450
Well then, see you Sunday.

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:25.120
Okay!

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:45.040
This is the first time I've seen Ito make that face.

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:49.080
Was Ayado the person that Ito likes?

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.080
What are you looking at?

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:53.330
Huh? Uh...

00:03:58.250 --> 00:03:59.660
Is this, perhaps... the blossoming of youth?

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:04.120
Wh-what are you talking about?!
There's no youth blossoming anywhere around here!

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:06.830
Jeez!

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:16.370
And you know, it's really awesome!

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:20.120
And also, like... Huh? Tsutsun?

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:22.620
Tsutsun?

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:24.580
Tsutsun!

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:26.750
Whoa! Wh-what is it?

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.500
What are you thinking about?

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:31.410
Uh, well... just...

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:34.580
You look like you're having a tough time.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:36.830
Because it's a tough problem.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:42.580
Hey, let's go on that kind of date again.

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:43.790
What kind of date?

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:48.080
Like karaoke and bowling.
I had a lot of fun the other day.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.910
Are movies and stuff fun?

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.750
Yeah! I think that's a good idea!

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:55.000
I see! So a movie is good!

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.080
You can do it, Ito!

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.040
Uh... What?

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:02.870
A movie date.

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:05.870
Huh? Oh... do you wanna go to a movie?

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:07.000
I do!

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.000
I cannot accept this!

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:21.120
It looks like everyone's enjoying
themselves except for me!

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:25.410
Arisa! Long time no see! You doin' okay?

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:27.750
Ugh, is that my ex?

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:31.080
You've gotten prettier, huh? Did you get a boyfriend?

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:33.830
No, I don't have one...

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:36.500
Then let's hang out this Sunday!

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:37.120
Huh?

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:52.000
It's been a while since I put serious effort
into my makeup, but...

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:53.660
I look pretty hot, right?

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:59.330
I look hot! Heck yeah!

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:05.160
Nose Blade

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:12.250
I'm here about forty minutes before our meeting time,
but... I honestly want to go home already.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:14.410
I wonder if the conversation will be okay...

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:17.450
No, that's why I took measures to meet at the venue...

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:18.870
It's okay, it's okay!

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:20.330
Ito-senpai!

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:25.290
You're already here, huh?

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:26.250
Y-yeah.

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:29.700
Thank you so much for inviting me today!

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:32.870
I was way too excited, so I also got here early!

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:45.250
That guy...

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:49.950
He begs me for money and gets angry so easily...
He was the absolute worst guy!

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:55.200
I'm an idiot. I'm going home.

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:56.330
Ishino.

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:57.450
Huh?

00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:00.160
What are you doing here?

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:07.700
No idea... What AM I doing here, honestly...

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:15.500
Ramen.

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:19.000
Wanna eat some?

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:20.790
Ramen...

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:25.040
Getting this cute to go eat ramen, huh?

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:27.830
Is that a no? Wanna go or not?

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:33.660
I'll go!

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:44.450
That was fun, wasn't it?

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:46.500
Y-you had fun?

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:47.500
Yes!

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.540
They did a remarkable job recalling
all the foreshadowing

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:51.410
from the TV broadcast and I was so impressed!

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:52.410
Y-yeah.

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:55.620
Really, I'm so glad you invited me out today!

00:07:55.790 --> 00:07:56.660
Yeah.

00:07:57.290 --> 00:08:02.700
She's like me, but she's done so much talking,
and always with a smile...

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:06.290
Ayado really is a good person...

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:12.080
Taking your advice and buying the pamphlet
beforehand was the right thing to do!

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:13.080
W-was it?

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:14.120
Yes!

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:18.290
It's just like... we're on a date or something...

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:20.830
Uh...

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:23.290
S-Senpai?

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:26.160
I-I'm sorry, it's nothing!

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:31.620
Thanks for coming!

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:36.370
That was delicious!

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:37.450
It was.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.120
What's up?

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:49.080
Nothing... I was just thinking about
how nice it is to be young!

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:51.200
You've got some spring onion in your teeth.

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:52.200
What?!

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:58.450
Ito-senpai!

00:08:58.870 --> 00:08:59.620
Oh?

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:01.700
Good morning!

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:03.080
Morning!

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:04.660
Morning...

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:08.160
Ito-senpai, here's your ticket stub.

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:12.250
Oh? What?! So they went together?!

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:16.580
I'm sorry, I took both of them home with me.

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:20.290
Th-thanks.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:27.750
R-right! You two went to the
movies together, huh? How was it?

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:29.620
It was a whole lot of fun!

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:33.290
I-I see! That's great! Yeah.

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:38.080
I-I will definitely go watch it again
so if you want to, let's go together!

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:41.500
Uh, what in the world am I saying?!

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:43.750
I-I'm sorry, that's not what I mean.

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:45.370
Huh? Uh, no...

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:52.750
W-well, I'm going back! P-please excuse me!

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:18.790
Ito is in love with Ayado right now, huh...?

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:22.790
What should I do now?

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:28.200
W-will he confess to her?!

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:32.750
No... I can't imagine Ito doing something like that.

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:38.950
I-I'm worried... Is there anything I can do?

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:44.620
Hikaru Tsutsui

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:49.540
Hello, Tsutsun? What's up?

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:52.620
Huh?

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:54.540
A picnic?

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:09.830
This is perfect weather for a picnic! Great!
And I also made a whole lot of sweets!

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:11.160
R-right.

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:13.290
What a wonderful park!

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:21.790
Wow! I haven't had your sweets in so long!

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:27.000
I'm sorry, I got a bit carried away
and made too much as well!

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.000
Whoa...

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:33.750
Sorry I didn't bring anything... I just made tea.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:36.330
It's alright. We all know what you can and can't do.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.660
This is amazing as always.

00:11:38.660 --> 00:11:40.290
Oh, no, that isn't true...

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:50.870
Um, was Ishino-senpai busy today?

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:52.120
Huh?! No...

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:56.500
I didn't invite her. I-I figured it's okay
to sometimes have just us here.

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.450
So Ito, h-how's it been going lately?

00:12:00.450 --> 00:12:03.750
Huh? Uh... normal, I guess?

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:06.450
Then that's great! Yeah, great! Great!

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:14.500
Tsutsui's being weird. He suddenly said he wanted to
go on a picnic... Maybe there's something on his mind.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:16.250
Ito-senpai.

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:18.750
Here, have a wet napkin.

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:20.830
Th-thanks.

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:25.700
H-hey, we're gonna go get something to drink!

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:27.040
Huh? We have drinks!

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:28.790
I REALLY wanna drink some cola!

00:12:32.370 --> 00:12:33.870
Tsutsun?

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:37.500
I want to leave those two alone for a bit, is that okay?

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:43.080
Maybe I'm just thinking this,
but are you trying to get Ito and Ayado together?

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:45.330
N-no! No, no!

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:50.290
I already know. I was thinking the same thing about Ito...

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.290
Y-you're amazing!

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:55.040
So? What do you want to do, Tsutsun?

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:57.000
Uh, what do you mean?

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:00.750
I mean, I was hoping that I could be
a really great assist somehow o-

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.000
You idiot! You're awful! So insensitive!

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:06.370
You shouldn't do things
that make people around you feel weird!

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:08.200
Why are you so angry?

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:09.660
I'm angry because of that!

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:13.620
Think about how Ayado feels.

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:16.790
I'm glad that it was to you.

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:19.330
O-ohhhhh...

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:24.200
I think that part of you is no good, Tsutsun. Really.

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:25.410
Right...

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:34.790
Wow, this is delicious!

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:39.000
That's a veggie sandwich that I made
from vegetables that I picked at my house!

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:40.250
Really?

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:43.950
There's something on your face...

00:13:43.950 --> 00:13:44.580
Huh?

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:46.410
Right around here.

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:48.160
Huh? Oh...

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:51.330
Th-thanks.

00:13:57.410 --> 00:14:03.000
This is painful... I can't talk with her.
Hurry up and come back, Tsutsui!

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:06.000
We're back.

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:10.250
Hey, it says we can play badminton over there.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:12.330
Wow! Let's play!

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:14.620
There!

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:16.580
I got it! I got it!

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:17.410
Whoa!

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:18.580
That one's mine!

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:34.660
D-did you have fun?

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:36.410
Huh? Yeah...

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:39.580
So, what kind of get-together was that?

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:40.450
Huh?!

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:45.250
Well, I mean... It's kind of rare
that you call me up and everything...

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.160
Did something happen?

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:49.160
Uh, with me?! No!

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:53.540
I see... Right...

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:56.950
I'm sorry I was so indirect.

00:14:57.370 --> 00:15:01.410
I wanted to ask you about who you like.

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:08.290
But you can start from where you want to.

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:15.910
Tsutsui, I...

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:22.750
The person that I like is Ayado.

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:25.580
Y-yeah.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:28.950
I see. So you knew.

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:32.910
Wait! I didn't do this because
I was trying to make fun of you!

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:38.540
I know that. Since it's you,
you were trying to help me, right?

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.750
Well, in the end I couldn't do any-

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:41.910
But...

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:46.950
to have you do something like that is pathetic.

00:15:48.450 --> 00:15:54.160
N-now I've done it. My thoughtlessness
has once again been activated!

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:59.550
2
Years
Ago

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:01.580
Girls?

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:04.000
I have no interest in them.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:06.040
I-I see.

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:10.500
No wa- That's so stupid!

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:13.120
They're so loud and crude.

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:17.290
There's not a single part of them
that measures up to a 2D girl.

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:19.950
Y-yeah. I feel pretty much the same.

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:27.000
Well... I've never been treated decently by a girl before,
so me falling in love or whatever would be weird.

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:31.620
Tsutsui.
Love is painful,
right?

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:32.000
Tsutsui. Love is painful, right?

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:35.160
But it's fun.

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:37.790
But it's fun. I mean, falling in love with people is...

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:38.200
I mean,
falling in love
with people

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.870
The door is closing.

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:47.700
Now leaving the station.

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:52.870
Wait, Ito!

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:54.250
Whoa!

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:57.370
Wh-what?!

00:16:57.370 --> 00:17:02.290
I'm really glad that you came to like a girl!

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:09.120
You've always been a much better
and nicer guy than I am,

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:15.370
and you've always supported me
as my one and only friend, so now...

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:17.700
I want you to be happy!

00:17:17.700 --> 00:17:22.620
Me saying something like this is probably insensitive,
but that's how I truly feel!

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:33.120
Tsutsui...

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:37.660
I don't know what to do and it hurts...

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:38.790
Yeah.

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:40.700
What do I do...?

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:42.580
Yeah.

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:52.450
I'm sorry for thinking that I could easily pull this off.

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:58.910
If people's hearts were so simple,
then we wouldn't be suffering like this...

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:13.250
Right... In the end, you made Ito cry.

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:15.540
That's how it goes, right?

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:18.910
I mean, Ayado likes you,

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:23.250
and that's why I said that there's nothing
you can do about this.

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.950
Right... Sorry.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:33.830
But I think you wanting to do something
for the sake of your friends is what's good about you.

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:45.870
Being able
to love someone
is fortunate

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:45.660
Being able to love someone is fortunate.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:49.200
Do you think it'll work out?

00:18:49.910 --> 00:18:51.080
I don't know.

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:54.370
But I hope it does.

00:18:55.750 --> 00:19:01.120
If the love is mutual,
it's all the more fortunate, like a miracle.

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:03.120
Good luck.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.120
Good luck, Ito.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:10.080
Iroha?

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:13.250
What? Chika?

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:18.660
Huh? What is up with this exceedingly good-looking guy?

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:29.200
Tsutsun! What are you doing?!

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:31.870
He was stalking you, right?

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:33.700
You idiot...

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:36.200
I'm sorry. Tsutsun, are you okay?

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:37.790
Y-yeah...

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:40.540
Hey, don't go near Iroha, ugly!

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:41.870
Stop it, Chika!

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.200
This person is my boyfriend!

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:47.910
Do you have some dirt on Iroha or something?

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:49.870
That's right... That's what's going on, huh?

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:51.450
Of course he doesn't!

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:53.790
What the hell...? Who's this guy?

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:56.910
C-could this be... her ex?!

00:19:57.450 --> 00:20:01.120
I'm sorry my younger brother
did something so weird out of the blue.

00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:03.700
Oh, younger brother?

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:06.250
He's been studying abroad this whole time, though.

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:08.870
I just got back.

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:10.500
We're going home, Iroha.

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:12.120
W-wait, Chika!

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:15.250
Tsutsun! I'll make him apologize to you properly later!

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:16.790
I'll get in touch with you!

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:19.700
Got it.

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:26.290
Her brother... he's her brother... that's great, but...

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:28.750
He kinda seems like a pain.

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:32.620
Well, I guess you would worry
if you have such a pretty sister.

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:37.000
I'm probably the type of human who
he would least want to become her boyfriend.

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:40.790
They're broken.

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:45.700
I can't believe this.

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:48.120
How could you just randomly punch him?!

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:53.040
Of course I'd misunderstand. I can't imagine
that dude would be a friend of yours.

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:56.330
He's not a friend, he's my boyfriend! We're dating!

00:20:57.700 --> 00:21:01.080
Jeez, if you talked to him properly,
you'd understand. He's very-

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:04.410
Of course I don't want you to date that weird guy.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:15.160
I came home because I was worried about you.

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:19.080
Huh?

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:40.750
Yume ga same sora nagamete omou
I wake from a dream and gaze at the sky

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:46.080
Mune wo utsu ano kotoba kirei da
And think of those beautiful words that touched my heart

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:50.450
Uwabe kazarazu hanasetara na...
If only I could talk to you without putting on airs...

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:55.950
Sobietatsu fuan no tou ga
Is the pillar of fear towering above it all

00:21:57.330 --> 00:22:00.330
Ari no mama de ii no kana??
Okay just the way it is?

00:22:00.910 --> 00:22:05.580
Nan oku kounen nayameba ii no darou??
For how many millions of light-years must I suffer??

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:08.750
Saa sugu doa akete
Come on, open the door now

00:22:08.910 --> 00:22:10.830
Ai ni yukou
And let's meet

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:15.750
Imi nado nai yo hotondo ga
Most of it means nothing, you know

00:22:16.330 --> 00:22:20.250
Kimi ni sokkou de minukareru no osorete
The fear that you immediately see through me

00:22:20.950 --> 00:22:25.450
Koukai bakari da ne futari wa kitto
Fills me with regret, surely

00:22:25.450 --> 00:22:30.500
Zutto miageteta sora wa sotto
The sky that we always stared up at, quietly

00:22:30.500 --> 00:22:35.410
Bokura no asu wo terasu kitto
It will brighten our tomorrow, surely

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:37.540
Kimi ni aitai desu
I want to see you

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:40.040
Sugoku kantan na koto nan jan ne
That's not a super easy thing, right?

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:42.790
Hora mijukumono
Hey, the inexperienced

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:46.540
Seishun believer desu
Are believers in youth.
